 class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater Island</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Building\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Building</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Illumine_Designs\" title=\"Illumine Designs\">Illumine Designs</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.4.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">March 10th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Normand Andy</b> is the cashier of <a href=\"/wiki/Illumine_Designs\" title=\"Illumine Designs\">Illumine Designs</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>They have the appearance of a stereotypical \"nerd\" person.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span></h2>\n<p>When you talk to him without any item in the counter, he will say: \n</p>\n<ul><li>\"*snorts* WELL akshully, you have to put the stuff NEAR the counter for me to sell it to you.\"\n<ul><li>Okay!\" (Ends conversation)</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p>When you talk to him with any item in the counter, he says: \n</p>\n<ul><li>\"You really want (item name)? That costs a hefty (price), it's important to make smart economical decisions. *snickers*\"\n<ul><li>Absolutely! (Purchases item)</li>\n<li>No thank you, I'm good. (Ends conversation)</li></ul></li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:NPC_Nav\" title=\"Template:NPC Nav\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:NPC_Nav\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:NPC_Nav?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\"><img alt=\"Oaklands Wiki\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e6/Site-logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/115?cb=20221025233312\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"115\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Site-logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Site-logo.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption>Oaklands Wiki</figcaption></figure>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:0; margin:0\">\n<table class=\"navbox\" style=\"border-radius:5px 5px 0 0; font-size:95%; padding:0; text-align:left; width:100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\" class=\"navbox-group\" style=\"background:#372A27; font-size:100%; border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0; text-align:cent